CM_ SG_ 2147545133 LtrlAlrtnExtnddRng "Lateral Acceleration (Extended Range): Indicates lateral acceleration of the vehicle (the component of vehicle acceleration vector along the Y-axis).  A positive lateral acceleration signal results when the vehicle is accelerated to the left.  This p...";
